{"id":"n48437-1-7","stage":4,"title":"대뜸 · 马上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48437-1-7-1","ko":"저 회사 그만두고 유학을 가기로 했어요.","zh":"我决定辞掉那家公司的工，去国外留学了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두고","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두고","audio":"/audio/f30a0252b08903bab4ef.mp3"}},{"text":"유학을","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유학을","audio":"/audio/e8b95de4667014b11aee.mp3"}},{"text":"가기로","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가기로","audio":"/audio/1a7fa13bb23284ecd122.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","se